{"id":"wb-7-289","name":"花地嘴遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"花地嘴遗址","text":"花地嘴遗址，原称水沟遗址，是位于中国河南省巩义市站街镇北瑶湾村南的古聚落遗址，主体遗存属于新砦期。遗址处于嵩山以北、伊洛河下游一带，发现有多重环壕、祭祀坑、房址和制陶遗迹。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8A%B1%E5%9C%B0%E5%98%B4%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":95081428,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95081428","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/ca4ad345ceda28719c4109c7.jpg","title":"20240817_Cinnabar_Painted_Pottery_Urn,_Huadizui_Site,_Xinzhai_Phase.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20240817_Cinnabar_Painted_Pottery_Urn,_Huadizui_Site,_Xinzhai_Phase.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8f/20240817_Cinnabar_Painted_Pottery_Urn%2C_Huadizui_Site%2C_Xinzhai_Phase.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​朱砂彩陶瓮，花地嘴遗址出土，新砦期","width":320,"height":480}}